s their denominators do: SUPPORTED on N4's 1,580 cards read as\n  1,580 of 790. The criteria were not affected.\n- S3 is also judged per condition of a stratum (oc.condition_rule). A\n  validator sound everywhere but undecided on a whole condition (E2, N6c,\n  N1's blind cards) passed the pooled stratum; a sound one misses a\n  condition's cell with probability <= 0.0001.\n- The relays' newest round is asked for before the round is named, and\n  again for up to 4 minutes after the run tag's push, inside the margin\n  (beacon.latest(within=...)). It was asked once, after the push.\n\nSix cosmetic findings:\n- the blind route's text in v1.md and oc.stratum;\n- the joint probability over 100,000 simulations, with its standard error\n  (0.912, 0.913 and 0.912);\n- S7b's resolution of 0.253%;\n- the rehearsal's wording on real data;\n- GATE 0's refusal pilot keeps only refusals and crashes before the key;\n- GATE 0's bound stated as outside the joint requirement.\n\noc.log is regenerated. The fixes were not reviewed again (no critical\nfinding).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MDGJh7hAAALAdwQFLhcwpp","timestamp":"2026-10-09T16:49:46Z","author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com"}},"repository":{"id":1289335561,"node_id":"R_kgDOTNmzCQ","name":"metric-autopsy","full_name":"mool32/metric-autopsy","private":false,"owner":{"login":"mool32","id":200848776,"node_id":"U_kgDOC_i1iA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200848776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mool32","html_url":"https://github.com/mool32","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mool32/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mool32/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mool32/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mool32/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subs